<title>USA: Hartmarx Corp Q2 May 31 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Hartmarx Corp Q2 May 31 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.01     loss	 $0.05</p>
<p> Net profit		   320     loss	 1,676</p>
<p> Revs		     169,735		  134,253</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  34,168		   32,963</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.05     loss	 $0.08</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,665     loss	 2,610</p>
<p> Revs		     346,853		  285,112</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  33,896		   32,901</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 6-mos net and shr include extraordinary gain of $725,000 on purchase of $13.5 million principal amount of 10.875-percent subordinated debentures, including $3.5 million in Q2, net of tax provision.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
